<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>用自己的资料回答，还告诉你「第几页」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>第四个时刻：它凭什么觉得就是这一段——凭四条不同的找法，而不是一条</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 1128, height: 132, flexDirection: 'row' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 256, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>找法一</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>按字面找</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>你写「导数」，就直接搜这两个字。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>命中准，但怕错一个字</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 110, background: '#E5E7EB', marginLeft: 16, marginRight: 16 }} />

    <Box style={{ width: 256, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>找法二</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>换个说法找</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>你问「本征值」，它知道资料里写的是「特征值」。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>救「同义不同词」</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 110, background: '#E5E7EB', marginLeft: 16, marginRight: 16 }} />

    <Box style={{ width: 256, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>找法三</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>短词兜底</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>「秩」「队列」这种两个字，别的找法会漏。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>救「太短搜不到」</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 110, background: '#E5E7EB', marginLeft: 16, marginRight: 16 }} />

    <Box style={{ width: 256, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>找法四</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>按意思找</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>一个字都不一样，但讲的是同一件事。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>救「换句话问」</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 340, width: 1128, height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 554, flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>然后把四份结果「按名次」合并</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>
        不能把四种分数直接相加——它们的单位根本不一样。只看各自排第几，再加权。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 554, flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>合并完再排一次序</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>
        看谁的原文里真的出现了你问的字、且出现在标题上——把「看着像」的往下压。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 458, width: 1128, height: 108, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 250, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>35</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>道检索题（配 21 篇资料）</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 250, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>34</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>道第一次就找对</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 250, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>35</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>道（接真实模型时全对）</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 300, flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingLeft: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
        把最后一层排序关掉，成绩从 0.9714 掉到 0.9571 —— 这一层不是装饰。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 588, width: 1128, height: 50, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      工程上叫：四路召回 + 加权名次融合（RRF）+ 词面精排；每一路都有它的「为什么」
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>06 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
